[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564839154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100915#issuecomment-2564839154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100915","id":2564839154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y4Fby","user":{"login":"MikkBenelis","id":17128667,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTI4NjY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17128667?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis","html_url":"https://github.com/MikkBenelis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikkBenelis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-29T21:09:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-29T21:11:42Z","body":"Seems like the `Main Scene` (`run/main_scene`) setting has a similar issue: Godot will not open the `Main Scene` after the \"cold\" loading if it is saved as `uid://` value, but open perfectly fine if it is saved as `res://`. Shoud I create a separate issue for that? Pretty sure it is the same, but in theory can require a fix in several places.\nP.S.: The `Main Scene` setting is automatically replaced with `uid` after manually changing it to `res`.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564839154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565056839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100915#issuecomment-2565056839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100915","id":2565056839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y46lH","user":{"login":"Summersay415","id":71974498,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTc0NDk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71974498?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415","html_url":"https://github.com/Summersay415","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Summersay415/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-30T06:01:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T06:01:15Z","body":"This maybe due to running scan of filesystem after loading environment and main scene, or something like what. Needs investigating","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565056839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599314079","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100915#issuecomment-2599314079","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100915","id":2599314079,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a7mKf","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T22:27:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T22:27:22Z","body":"The environment is loaded in SceneTree constructor, which happens before any filesystem scan that could load the UID. And interestingly, the code deletes the settting if file can't be found.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9630d4e2fc1d0fdef6f46f24e236548549f31d49/scene/main/scene_tree.cpp#L1970-L1984","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599314079/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2601040098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100915#issuecomment-2601040098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100915","id":2601040098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bCLji","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T22:07:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T22:07:48Z","body":"After analyzing the problem further, I have identified a few related issues and concerns:\n\n1. Before the first scan, the only source to link a UID to a path is the UID cache, which presents several issues:\n   - CI/CD will not function properly without the cache file being included in source control.\n   - If a file is moved outside the editor (e.g., due to a Git pull while the editor is closed), the correct paths will not be available when the editor starts.\n   - Any attempt to access a UID before the first scan will fail.\n\n2. There is a missing `ResourceUID::ensure_path(` call in the comparison within `main.cpp`:\n   The line `game_path != String(GLOBAL_GET(\"application/run/main_scene\"))` should include this call to ensure the UID is converted in the same way as when `game_path` is initialized.\n\nI seriously believe that the only way to ensure the UID cache is up to date is to reload the UID files before the first call to `ResourceUID::path_to_uid`. One possible solution is to make `EditorFileSystem::_scan_new_dir` a static method and invoke it in `main.cpp`. By storing the `ScannedDirectory`, we could reuse it in `EditorFileSystem::_first_scan_filesystem`, thus preventing a double scan. \n\nHowever, the main challenge with this approach is that it will be difficult to display a progress bar during the first scan, as the main window is created after the initial call to `ResourceUID::path_to_uid`. Maybe creating a temporaire small loading window could be an idea.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2601040098/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610894914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100915#issuecomment-2610894914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100915","id":2610894914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bnxhC","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T19:55:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T19:55:42Z","body":"After a bit more investigating, this approach will not work perfectly. The main issue is the possibility to have custom `ResourceLoader` with custom `get_resource_uid` methods from plugins and GDExtensions. I guess it would be difficult to load these plugins sooner in the editor startup. So the best approach should probably be to refactor the code the load the resource after the `EditorFileSystem` first scan when in the Editor. It's just very difficult to find every places the access `ResourceUid` before the first scan.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2610894914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]